# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Permanent Ascend grants a lasting blessing at ten permanents.
# Forcing: Two Saprolings raise eight permanents to ten. Destroying an artifact lowers it to nine.
# AI behavior: Empty hand and battlefield eliminate opposing decisions.
# Failure modes: Missing blessing or 1/1 Saprolings after acquisition exposes a failed threshold or projection.
# Card roles: Dryad owns Ascend and the conditional bonus. Migration creates two tokens. Ornithopter is the removable permanent. Naturalize removes it. Forests pay both spells.
# Protocol path: Ascend count badge, player designation gain and persistence, refreshed creature stats.
